<div class="modal fade" id="modal-idigbio-multi-result" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-label" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="modal-label">More than one iDigBio record found
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        </button>
        </h5>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>There are more than one iDigBio specimen with the occurrence ID you have specified:</p>
        <ul id="idb-records">
        </ul>
        <p>If you click Save, the specimen will still be saved with the Occurrence ID, but the specimen will not be updated to match the iDigBio record.  You can also click Cancel and return to the edit page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button id="btn-save" type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
